<title>CROATIA: TABLE - Croatian tobacco plant net double in '96.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Croatian tobacco plant net double in '96.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for calendar 1996 for tobacco plant Tvornica Duhana Rovinj.</p>
<p>Millions of kuna unless otherwise stated</p>
<p>    net profit		   144.53     vs	 73.65</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit	     192.29     vs	108.05</p>
<p>    tax			     47.75     vs	 34.40</p>
<p>Note: Tvornica Duhana Rovinj faxed its annual results to Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Zagreb newsroom +385 1 455 7075</p>
</text>
